beauty with a slightly cold attitude."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she has been subbing for Mariko on \"Prime Time News\", she has proven herself to be a very capable newscaster."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since the beginning of \"Prime Time News,\" she has been distant from Mariko, and Mariko believes that Saeko is jealous of her being the main newscaster."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44444"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/375e4dd08f1ffabc758ee9db1046c35f35326cdb18590587a3a62ab7c8216e27.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9dfd289af03910edfd84b6ea666a5701d670b24060259026087e6224628707ac.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北条 明日香","creatorId":"vndb:s1016","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1016","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1016","name":"北条 明日香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:38423","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c44447","characterName":"雪村 香織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c44447"},"originalCharacterName":"雪村 香織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is currently one of the most popular idols. She wears her hair in braids and has a cheerful personality, and has appeared on many variety shows."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an active and energetic personality. Although she is still young, she has an independent side to her, and is a little doubtful about her current position as an idol."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She often sees Mariko at the station and looks up to her like an older sister, respecting and tru